  "body": "Download file: https://filefling.co.nz/property/66awesttamak0\r\n\r\nAs the Pohutukawa on this tree-lined street transition to summer flowering, here's a red-hot scenario set to assure you of fun in the sun in a popular, sought-after neighbourhood. Set well back from the road on a rear section, the immaculately renovated single level three-bedroom home has an elevated urban aspect. \r\n\r\nThe freestanding 130 sqm (approx.) home has a contemporary, light filled interior with front door leading directly into the generous open plan living and dining rooms. Smart timber laminate flooring contrasts with fresh white walls while attractive drapes screen two sets of double doors accessing the large wraparound deck ideal for barbecues and alfresco socialising. A sleek kitchen boasting black granite benchtops, gas hob and a suite of stainless-steel appliances integrates plenty of generous cabinetry including a sizable pantry. Carpeted bedrooms are warm and inviting with all three sharing the elegant Italian inspired tiled bathroom and a separate toilet. A heat pump in the lounge keeps the home cosy and comfortable all year round while a single internal access garage has integrated laundry and storage for household clobber - from bikes to scooters and skateboards.\r\n\r\nThe private cross lease section has forecourt parking, patios, fenced lawns for kids and pets and enough room to tend your own vege beds. Walking distance to reach a range of excellent schooling with Glen Taylor School nearby, while St Ignatius School, and Glendowie College are also in zone. Within a short walk of both Paddington and Crossfield Reserves for a range of community facilities and sportsgrounds and handy to St Heliers beach precinct for boutiques and eateries, this well positioned property is close to public transport for the city commute.\r\n\r\nContact Hamish and Alice for more information.",
